# Maktab Dars Jadvali

O'zbekiston maktablari uchun dars jadvali tizimi. UI o'zbek tilida. Batafsil: `agents.md`.

## Stack

React 18 + Vite + Tailwind/shadcn (client/) · Hono + Drizzle (server/) · PostgreSQL/Supabase · Wouter (React Router emas)

## Buyruqlar

```bash
npm run dev          # Dev server (default port 5001)
npm run check        # TypeScript
npm run db:push      # Dev schema sync
npm run build && npm start
```

## Muhim qoidalar

- API: frontendda **faqat** `apiRequest()` — to'g'ridan-to'g'ri `fetch()` emas
- Auth: Supabase Auth, token `getAuthHeaders()` orqali
- DB: soft delete (`isActive: false`), schema `shared/schema.ts`, storage `server/storage/`
- Yangi Hono route: `server/routes/*.ts` → `server/routes/index.ts` ga `app.route()`
- `/api/teacher-load` va `/api/teacher-recommendation` alohida routerlar
- Boshlang'ich o'qituvchi qoidalari: `shared/constants.ts` (`PRIMARY_TEACHER_ALLOWED_SUBJECTS`)
- Scratch skriptlar (`scratch/`) va `dist/` ni o'zgartirmang — faqat dev/test

## Tuzilma

```
client/src/pages|components|hooks|lib
server/routes|services|middleware|storage
shared/schema.ts, shared/constants.ts, shared/curriculum.ts
```
